---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us – Shakarganj Foundation"
  description="Discover the history, objectives, and community impact of Shakarganj Foundation across Pakistan."
>
  <section class="page_hero_banner">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero_breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span>›</span>
        <span>About Us</span> <span>›</span>
        <span class="current">Introduction</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero_page_title">About Shakarganj Foundation</h1>
      <p class="hero_subtitle">A non-profit organization dedicated to human welfare, social development, and community empowerment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="text-block">
          <span class="badge badge-primary">OUR JOURNEY</span>
          <h2 class="section-heading">Building a Compassionate & Empowered Future</h2>
          <p>
            Shakarganj Foundation was established with a clear mandate: to create meaningful, enduring social change for marginalized populations. Over the years, the foundation has evolved into a premier philanthropic organization in Pakistan, driving sustainable progress across key sectors.
          </p>
          <p>
            Operating predominantly in Jhang and surrounding regions, the foundation focuses on expanding access to high-quality education, providing subsidized and free medical care, nurturing artistic heritage through the Jhang Art Gallery, and supporting emergency relief efforts.
          </p>
          <div class="key-highlights">
            <div class="highlight-item">
              <strong>100% Philanthropic Focus:</strong> Reinvesting resources directly into school infrastructure, student scholarships, and medical clinics.
            </div>
            <div class="highlight-item">
              <strong>Community Partnership:</strong> Collaborating closely with local elders, schools, and medical professionals to address urgent community needs.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="image-block">
          <div class="card about-card">
            <div class="card-body">
              <h3>Core Pillars of Service</h3>
              <ul class="pillars-list">
                <li>
                  <span class="icon">🎓</span>
                  <div>
                    <strong>Educational Grants & Scholarships</strong>
                    <p>Subsidizing school fees and university tuition for deserving scholars.</p>
                  </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="icon">🏥</span>
                  <div>
                    <strong>Subsidized Healthcare & Free Clinics</strong>
                    <p>Operating outpatient clinics, maternal health units, and nutrition centers.</p>
                  </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="icon">🎨</span>
                  <div>
                    <strong>Heritage Preservation</strong>
                    <p>Sponsoring local crafts, carpet weaving, and traditional artisan skill development.</p>
                  </div>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .content-section {
      padding: 70px 0;
    }
    .section-heading {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin: 15px 0 20px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
    }
    .text-block p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .key-highlights {
      margin-top: 25px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 15px;
    }
    .highlight-item {
      background: var(--bg-light);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-color);
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-dark);
    }
    .about-card {
      border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-gold);
    }
    .pillars-list {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .pillars-list li {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .pillars-list .icon {
      font-size: 24px;
      background: rgba(0, 77, 0, 0.08);
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .pillars-list strong {
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .pillars-list p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
